<title>UK: Nomura sets call warrants on Tottenham.</title>
<headline>Nomura sets call warrants on Tottenham.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it has issued American-style call warrants on shares of Tottenham Hotspur Plc.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6.50 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  1.95 STG</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   31.DEC.98		 LISTING	LUX</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  6.95 STG</p>
<p> NOTES	     SETTLEMENT IS CASH ONLY</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
